# Expected upstream PAM fingerprints

These files are the stock Arch and Omarchy stacks that `tools/install-pam.sh`
may replace on first install without `--force`. A live `/etc/pam.d` file that
does not match one of these snapshots (or the t2touch replacement template)
prints a diff and requires `--force` or `T2TOUCH_FORCE_PAM=1`.
